    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of an organic compound was analysed by Kjeldahl&#39;s method for the estimation of nitrogen. If the percentage of nitrogen in the compound was found to be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>42</mn><mo>%</mo></math>, then.......&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mL</mi></math> of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> would have been neutralized by the ammonia evolved during the analysis."
  },
